# Headless tour of engine_input (cargo xtask sim-smoke): pointer, gestures, keys, encoder.
# Inputs due at a frame apply before it is drawn and shots after, so each shot waits a frame.
wait 32
shot initial
# Tap a checkable box (2), then double-tap box 1.
tap 140 45
wait 400
tap 50 45
wait 100
tap 50 45
wait 32
shot taps
# Long press on box 5 (log: LongPressed, LongPressedRepeat…).
press 140 105
wait 32
shot pressed
wait 600
release
wait 400
# Swipe left over the grid: Gesture(LEFT) on the screen.
drag 250 160 60 160 160
wait 400
# Keyboard: Tab to the right column, back to the grid, arrows inside, Enter clicks.
key Next
wait 32
shot focus_a
key Prev
key Right
key Down
wait 32
shot gridnav
key Enter
wait 32
text "hi"
# Wheel: focus moves on; middle click on the editable box enters edit mode.
wheel 2
wait 32
enc_press
wait 50
enc_release
wait 32
shot edit_mode
wheel 1
wheel -2
wait 32
key Esc
wait 100
shot final_state
wait 32
# `+` / `-` resize the grid boxes: the flex row wraps them onto more or fewer rows.
key -
key -
key -
wait 32
shot narrow
wait 32
key +
key +
key +
key +
key +
key +
wait 32
shot wide
